{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"arch-title","type":"text","text":"# 🏗️ Architecture\n\nData flow across the multi-agent pipeline. CEO is the only orchestrator — sub-agents never call each other directly.","x":-1500,"y":-750,"width":700,"height":140,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"user","type":"text","text":"## 👤 User\n\nNatural-language requests in Hebrew or English","x":-1500,"y":-200,"width":240,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ceo","type":"text","text":"## 🧠 CEO Agent\n*main Claude session*\n\n**Responsibilities**\n- Parse intent + language\n- Decompose & route\n- Sequence sub-agent calls\n- Synthesize outputs\n- Trigger QA loop (up to 3 rounds)\n- Deliver to user\n\n**Contract:** `.claude/agents/ceo/agent.md`","x":-1150,"y":-260,"width":360,"height":360,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"chen","type":"text","text":"### 🔍 חן (AGT-03)\n**Web Research**\n\nWebSearch + WebFetch → quality filter → save source.\nDedups via memory log.\n\n`.claude/agents/chen.md`","x":-680,"y":-700,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"yael","type":"text","text":"### ✍️ יעל (AGT-01)\n**Rewriter**\n\nReads Content/, applies house style, outputs MD + HTML to Output/.\n\n`.claude/agents/yael.md`","x":-680,"y":-420,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"yuval","type":"text","text":"### 🎨 יובל (AGT-02)\n**Image Designer**\n\nReads reference/, crafts prompt, calls OpenAI Images, saves PNG + .txt sidecar.\n\n`.claude/agents/yuval.md`","x":-680,"y":-140,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"guy","type":"text","text":"### ✅ גיא (AGT-04)\n**QA Gatekeeper**\n\nAudits Output/ vs brief + style + structure + images. Only agent allowed to reject.\n\n`.claude/agents/guy.md`","x":-680,"y":140,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"websearch","type":"text","text":"🌐 **WebSearch + WebFetch**\n\nBuilt-in Claude tools\n(no API key)","x":-280,"y":-700,"width":240,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"content","type":"text","text":"📂 **Content/**\n\nRaw articles with YAML header:\n`source · fetched · author · published · language`","x":-280,"y":-550,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"memory","type":"text","text":"📂 **chen/Memory/**\n`searches.md`\n\nDedup ledger + search log","x":-280,"y":-380,"width":240,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"styleguide","type":"text","text":"📄 **yael/style-guide.md**\n+ `yael/reference/`\n\nHouse style (currently placeholder)","x":-280,"y":-230,"width":240,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"output","type":"text","text":"📂 **Output/**\n\n`.md` + `.html` (RTL when Hebrew)\nInline CSS, max-width 720px","x":60,"y":-420,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"yref","type":"text","text":"📂 **yuval/reference/**\n\nStyle inspiration\n(manual upload)","x":-280,"y":-80,"width":240,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"openai","type":"text","text":"🌐 **OpenAI Images API**\n\nModel: `gpt-image-2`\nAuth: `.env` → `OPENAI_API_KEY`\ncurl + base64 decode","x":60,"y":-80,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"youtput","type":"text","text":"📂 **yuval/outputs/**\n\n`<YYYY-MM-DD>-<slug>.png`\n+ `.txt` (prompt sidecar)","x":60,"y":80,"width":240,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"qareports","type":"text","text":"📂 **guy/QA_Reports/**\n\n`<YYYY-MM-DD-HHMM>-<slug>.md`\n5 checks · ✅/❌ verdict","x":60,"y":220,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"qaloop","type":"text","text":"## 🔁 QA Loop (3 rounds max)\n\n1. CEO invokes גיא after יעל\n2. ✅ → present to user · ❌ → re-invoke יעל with corrections\n3. After round 3 — present alongside QA report for manual decision\n\nגיא is the **only** agent allowed to reject.","x":480,"y":-260,"width":380,"height":280,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"language-rule","type":"text","text":"## 🌐 Language Rule\n\nCEO detects input language per task.\n\n- Hebrew → Hebrew (full RTL)\n- English → English\n- Mixed → dominant language\n\nNo mid-sentence mixing.","x":480,"y":80,"width":380,"height":220,"color":"6"}
	],
